  "description": "KA.Barcode Reader is a VB.NET barcode scanner library to read, scan QR Code, Data Matrix, Code 128, EAN/UPC and other barcode in your ASP.NET Core web and Windows applications.\n\nThis package includes detailed example VB.NET source code to scan, read, decode barcode data message from barcode image file in .NET projects.\n\nGuides:\n* How to Guide : https://www.keepautomation.com/guide/vbnet_barcode_reader.html\n* Email : support@keepautomation.com",
